      "headline": "AI-linked stocks slide after tech bosses call for slowdown in ‘reckless’ development",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "AI-linked stocks tumbled on Monday after the bosses of Anthropic, OpenAI and SpaceX called for a slowdown in AI “reckless” development, citing fears the technology could soon run out of control.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-15T08:03:25.712138+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "1eb32e04a0580d5e1b2f1fe6050aa99ac3c9a27ffd0c10dfeafd64f434958373",
          "excerpt": "AI-linked stocks tumbled on Monday after the bosses of Anthropic, OpenAI and SpaceX called for a slowdown in AI “reckless” development, citing fears the technology could soon run out of control.",
          "sentence_hash": "0dd6610913d880e1261af960b676c5d5907701757eaf5687134e9e5f6ae50283",
          "anchors": [
            "un",
            "and"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "Shares in the semiconductor designer Nvidia – the world’s most valuable company – were down 3.3% by market closing in New York City, while Advanced Micro Devices (AMD) slid 4% and Micron Technology and Sandisk shares slumped by 5%.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-15T08:03:25.712180+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "1eb32e04a0580d5e1b2f1fe6050aa99ac3c9a27ffd0c10dfeafd64f434958373",
          "excerpt": "Shares in the semiconductor designer Nvidia – the world’s most valuable company – were down 3.3% by market closing in New York City, while Advanced Micro Devices (AMD) slid 4% and Micron Technology and Sandisk shares slumped by 5%.",
          "sentence_hash": "000b66b6f5aa79bce5b35fb04d62f65f3d48d8b1c2916483f4fbf3f9dbfbda4f",
          "anchors": [
            "3.3%",
            "and",
            "3%",
            "5%",
            "shares",
            "4%"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "The tech-heavy Nasdaq index fund was down 0.5% by the end of the day.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-15T08:03:25.712201+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "1eb32e04a0580d5e1b2f1fe6050aa99ac3c9a27ffd0c10dfeafd64f434958373",
          "excerpt": "The tech-heavy Nasdaq index fund was down 0.5% by the end of the day.",
          "sentence_hash": "a0b11374c0c9486a9632dcf3b5914fd7c06d5532cda15ff4232a794e26a7c9e3",
          "anchors": [
            "un",
            "0.5%",
            "5%"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "However, Donald Trump dismissed calls to increase controls on AI as a “sick conspiracy”.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-15T08:03:25.712232+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "1eb32e04a0580d5e1b2f1fe6050aa99ac3c9a27ffd0c10dfeafd64f434958373",
          "excerpt": "However, Donald Trump dismissed calls to increase controls on AI as a “sick conspiracy”.",
          "sentence_hash": "d0b864c858db47ce038c96683edffdd8edfda51299c01919e170a71b3242ec53",
          "anchors": [
            "sick"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "In a social media post on Monday, the president wrote: “The only control or ‘guardrails’ that AI needs is a STRONG AND SMART (High IQ!) PRESIDENT, and the USA has that, in spades!” The president added that his administration had “stopped AI ‘people’ from doing bad, or potentially",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-15T08:03:25.712270+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "1eb32e04a0580d5e1b2f1fe6050aa99ac3c9a27ffd0c10dfeafd64f434958373",
          "excerpt": "In a social media post on Monday, the president wrote: “The only control or ‘guardrails’ that AI needs is a STRONG AND SMART (High IQ!) PRESIDENT, and the USA has that, in spades!” The president added that his administration had “stopped AI ‘people’ from doing bad, or potentially",
          "sentence_hash": "afe01dc6d924b0d39cb0f65d3460ab01e53c9095b841b1378a19bc213d138cb6",
          "anchors": [
            "his",
            "and",
            "ai"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f6",
          "text": "“There is a SICK conspiracy going on against AI and Data Centers, and the only one that is happy about it is China.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-15T08:03:25.712295+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "1eb32e04a0580d5e1b2f1fe6050aa99ac3c9a27ffd0c10dfeafd64f434958373",
          "excerpt": "“There is a SICK conspiracy going on against AI and Data Centers, and the only one that is happy about it is China.",
